  "decision_summary": "Most structurally similar polyphenols and flavonoids show direct brain detection after systemic administration in rodents, supporting meaningful CNS access. The few negative signals are either human CSF data for a single analogue or a low-similarity pterocarpan, and do not override the consistent positive brain-uptake evidence.",
